  ("Esth 3","The proud official Haman, enraged by Mordecai's refusal to bow to him, orchestrates a decree for the genocide of all Jews in the empire."),
  ("Esth 4","Mordecai urges Esther to intervene, famously reminding her she may have been placed in her position 'for such a time as this.'"),
